depends 2180idle
receive 1
+ idling
send 2
done
a uid store 3:4 +flags.silent (idlehurry)
# the new flag makes the server re-announce the mailbox flag list
receive 4
i OK done
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen idlehurry)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen idlehurry \*)] permanent flags
a OK done
end
